## Task 1 end-to-end transcript (FLEET_TASKS_HOME=/tmp/fleet-task-e2e.*)

```
bun fleet-task.ts --role cord init
→ {"ok":true,"home":"/tmp/fleet-task-e2e.…"}

bun … mission open --id m-e2e --project agent-core --project-root /Users/jrg/agent-core --title "e2e mission"
→ {"ok":true,"id":"m-e2e"}

bun … unit open --mission m-e2e --id u-e2e --title "e2e unit" --owner-agent orch-fleet-task-cli
→ {"ok":true,"id":"u-e2e"}

bun … write --unit u-e2e --merge false --json '[{t1 pending},{t2 pending}]'
→ ok, needs_in_progress:true, unit progress pending:2 total:2

bun … write --unit u-e2e --merge true --json '[{t1 in_progress}]'
→ ok, unit+mission rollup in_progress; Tower: u-e2e pending→in_progress, m-e2e pending→in_progress

bun … render --unit u-e2e
→ m-e2e / u-e2e: e2e unit
    ◐ seed task
    ○ second

bun … write t2→in_progress → exit 1 "at most one in_progress orch task…"
bun … write t2→completed → exit 1 "illegal transition … pending → completed"
```

